趙","place_name_jianti_auto":"赵","resolved_place_entity_id":88,"start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"8d4dad4c-db0e-11ef-a554-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"鄴","place_name_jianti_auto":"邺","place_note":"河北临漳南邺镇","resolved_place_entity_id":101,"start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"8d4dad4d-db0e-11ef-9ca1-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"太原","place_name_jianti_auto":"太原","place_note":"山西太原","resolved_place_entity_id":192,"start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"8d4dad4e-db0e-11ef-ab8a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"狼孟","place_name_jianti_auto":"狼孟","place_note":"山西阳曲","resolved_place_entity_id":4998,"start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"8d4dad4f-db0e-11ef-b610-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"番吾","place_name_jianti_auto":"番吾","place_note":"河北磁縣","resolved_place_entity_id":5025,"start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"8d4dad50-db0e-11ef-b39f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[{"title":"番吾之战","tongjian_id":"war_N0544"},{"title":"秦灭赵之战","tongjian_id":"war_N0546"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/四、真定府（卷十四）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"即蒲吾也。汉置蒲吾县。晋及后魏县皆治此。隋大业初，省入井...","context_before":"...番吾，迎战邯郸下。又曰：秦赵战于番吾之下，再战而再胜秦。","source_end_index":109,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"f1fc1293-54e3-5a19-8a82-6e629be7da80","source_start_index":85,"source_text":"《史记》：赵王迁四年，秦攻番吾。李牧与战，却之。"}],"path":"北直方舆纪要/四、真定府（卷十四）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/一、太原府（卷四十）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"寻置县，属太原郡。两汉因之。晋属太原国。后魏省。俗名黄头...","context_before":"狼孟城[府北七十里。本赵邑。秦庄襄王二年，攻赵狼孟。","source_end_index":47,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"07f362ae-c89a-5c61-8c08-adb7eef5df49","source_start_index":26,"source_text":"又始皇十五年伐赵，军至太原，取狼孟。是也。"}],"path":"山西方舆纪要/一、太原府（卷四十）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["军事"],"content":"1王大興師伐趙，一軍抵鄴，一軍抵太原，取狼孟、番吾；遇李牧而還。","content_fanyi":"秦王大规模发兵攻赵，一路进抵邺，一路进抵太原，攻取狼孟、番吾；遇到李牧的军队，于是撤回。","content_jianti_auto":"1王大兴师伐赵，一军抵邺，一军抵太原，取狼孟、番吾；遇李牧而还。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":513,"number":1,"reading_annotatio